<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia goods, services in deficit in Jan.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia goods, services in deficit in Jan.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia's seasonally-adjusted balance on goods and services showed a deficit of A$63 million in January compared to December's surplus of A$235 million, the Australian Bureau of Statistics said.</p>
<p>This compares with a seasonally adjusted deficit of A$16 million in January 1996.</p>
<p>Economists had on average forecast a deficit of A$230 million million for the balance of goods and services.</p>
</text>
